      "message": "I initially tried decoding directly into `colorType` / `alphaType`, but this doesn\u0027t always work - in particular for some cases `SkCodec::conversionSupported` would see `!valid_alpha` / would dislike opaque alpha: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/codec/SkCodec.cpp;l\u003d261-263;drc\u003d8f0238837ee48947b0428c1a2e7947c6fc6def2f\n\nSo I ended up decoding into kRGBA_8888, and then using `skcms_Transform` to get the real color type that I want to test with.",
